  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/epic-jujutsu-story\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">地圖連結 (Map Link)</span></strong></a><strong><br><br>此整合包收錄了多項模組，包含狀態顯示系統與對抗《咒術迴戰》世界中咒靈的戰鬥內容。在遊戲中您將成為術師，不斷變強直至擊敗咒靈之王。此外，內建 Custom Npc 模組，僅建議搭配我的地圖遊玩，以便解鎖自訂任務並體驗講述《咒術迴戰》動畫劇情的故事線。本整合包提供「Epic」與一般兩個版本。「Epic」版附帶 Epic Fight 模組，但由於資源需求較高，可能無法在部分電腦上正常運行，因此我也準備了「Lite」輕量版。<br><br>此整合包專為遊玩我的地圖而設計，兩者位於不同頁面。若您僅想下載整合包，仍建議一併尋找地圖檔案，體驗會更加完整。</strong></span><br><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>此整合包收錄了多項模組，包含狀態系統與對抗《咒術迴戰》世界中的咒靈戰鬥，玩家將扮演術師不斷成長，直到擊敗咒靈之王。</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>此外，模組還包含 Custom Npc，僅在搭配遊玩我的地圖時才能發揮作用，用於解鎖自訂任務並體驗講述《咒術迴戰》動畫劇情的故事線。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>本整合包提供兩個版本：附帶「Epic」與一般版本。「Epic」版內建 Epic Fight 模組，但由於較為耗用系統資源，可能無法在部分電腦上運行，因此我也提供了「Lite」輕量版。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#f00\">此整合包專為遊玩我的地圖而設計，兩者位於不同頁面。若您僅想下載整合包，仍建議一併搜尋地圖檔案，體驗會更加精彩。</span></strong></span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組感謝名單：<br><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-hud\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><u><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Rpg-HUD</span></u></em></a></em><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-plaques\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Advancement Plaques</em></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><u>Better Advancement</u></em></a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" rel=\"nofollow\">Collective</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/construction-wand\" rel=\"nofollow\">Construction Wand</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cosmetic armor reworked</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\">Customnpcs</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mmmmmmmmmmmm</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-x-jujutsucraft-compatability-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight x Jujutsucraft compatability</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicnpc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epicnpc</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Guandao Moveset</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-unbreakable-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple unbreakable tools</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iceberg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iceberg</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sorceryfight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu Craft</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jujutsu-kaisen-gt\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu GT</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jujutsu-animation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu Animation</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lock-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lock-on</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obfuscate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obfuscate</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pehkui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pehkui</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playerex\" rel=\"nofollow\">Playerex</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moonlight Lib</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structurize\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structurize</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torohealth-damage-indicators\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torohealth damage indicators</a></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wall-jump\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wall-jump</a></em></span></strong></span></p>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:0px\"></div>",
